          isPrivate: false
          description: >-
            # 🆕 Create an ticket


            **Method:** `POST`  

            **Endpoint:** `/api/invite/ticket`  

            **Description:** Creates an ticket invite link that which has number
            of users that can use it and the time in which it expires


            ---


            ### 🧾 Request Body


            | Field            | Type     | Required |
            Description                                                  |

            |----------------- |--------- |---------
            |------------------------------------------------------------ |

            | `ticket_name`       | string   | ✅       | The name of the ticket
            |

            | `ticket_price`         | number   | ✅       | The price of the
            ticket |

            | `ticket_for` | mumber (optional defaults to 1)   | ✅       |The
            number of that each ticket represents (group of 5)|

            | `ticket_quantity` | mumber   | ✅       |The number of tickets the
            organizer want   |

            | `scope` | string enum (private ?? public ?? institution) (defaults
            to public)    | ✅  |How should the the infromation being
            displayed  |

            | `institutions` | array (optional if scope is institution)   |
            ✅       |The list of institution's id of which the tickets should be
            viewed by  |

            | `start_date` | date  | ✅       |The start date of the ticket   |

            | `end_date` | date   | ✅       |The end start of the ticket |



            ```json
            	{
            	 "ticket_name": "VIP Ticket",  
            	 "ticket_price": 15, 
            	 "ticket_for":5,  
            	 "ticket_quantity": 200, 
            	 "scope": "public" ,  
            	 "institutions" : [1],
            	 "start_date": "2026-05-10T00:00:00.000Z",
               "end_date": "2026-05-11T00:00:00.000Z"
            	}
            ```

            ---


